epistle-panel (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release. The package is thin: it installs
    /usr/share/glyndor/epistle-panel/image, one line naming the container image
    tag that matches the package version, and a README for that file. epistle
    reads it to add the panel to the stack it generates.
  * Carries no Node runtime and no application code, and creates no account,
    no directory and no secret.

 -- Glyndor <packages@glyndor.net>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
